# 0.1.4 (LIST-0.1.4 items 2 and 3): Extra vibration's hit and pickups on Geyser Rock's iron crate. Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_WARP=crate (Jak a metre over the first crate) and JAKVR_FEEL_TRACE=1 on gkcfg-feel: into play as
# jak1_actions.sim, then a jump and the dive (X in the air) onto the crate, twice, then an uppercut beside it. Look for
# "[vr-feel] hit (0 0; ...)" (the dive breaks it: an iron crate takes only a dive or an uppercut, not a kick) and its scout fly, "[vr-feel] big pickup (8 0; ...)".
